<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu edges up to 4.6047 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu edges up to 4.6047 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu rose to 4.6047 per dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange from 4.6050 on Friday.</p>
<p>				    Oct 7		   Oct 4</p>
<p> lei per dollar		 4.6047		  4.6050</p>
<p> volume traded ($)	    10,000		  300,000</p>
